  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Purpose/Objective: To prevent the deterioration of food security among highly vulnerable and food insecure households affected by natural disasters and other shocks in Heart Province; To support the most impacted populations through food and CBT modalities during the lean season in specific areas.
 
 WVUK has a 2.69% share in this project.</narrative>
